It looks like undoc() produces a false warning with packages
that have no namespace and are using S4 methods.

I could track the problem down to tools:::.get_S4_methods_list which
returns the summary,sparseMatrix-method as a method defined in
"fRegression" which is obviously not the case.


Regards,
Yohan


